# oodac — compiler
File: website/pulled/oodac.oot

Source: openOODA/oodac/docs/

## What it is

The sovereign compiler. Tag v0.2.11. Lexer, parser,
typecheck, capability check, and emit-c / emit-llvm.

Backends: ELF64 (x86_64 and AArch64), WebAssembly, C99
(links oodar), LLVM IR, GPU (HIP/PTX/Metal/SPIR-V).

The compiler is the substrate. std, ooda, lsp, mcp, and opm
consume it. They are siblings, not children of a monorepo.
`ooda build` and `ooda run` exec this binary via
`OODA_COMPILER`.

## Surface

12 public subdirs (from `oodac/ANCHOR.oo`):

| Dir | Role |
|-----|------|
| `lex/` | Scanner |
| `ast/` | Parser and Merkle AST |
| `check/` | Caps, typestate, SMT, typecheck |
| `types/` | Type IR |
| `emit/c/` | C99 |
| `emit/x86/` | x86_64 ELF |
| `emit/aarch64/` | AArch64 ELF / Mach-O |
| `emit/wasm/` | WebAssembly |
| `emit/llvm/` | LLVM IR |
| `emit/gpu/` | GPU kernels |
| `vm/` | Bytecode VM |
| `cli/` | `oodac` command surface |

Do not copy `./bin/ooda` onto `./oodac/oodac`.
